  "bio": "Nov Keallau is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Yau Tsim Mong, Hong Kong-China, known for their unique and intricate designs in trashpolka and anime styles. Working out of @hazy_night_tattoo, Nov brings exceptional artistry to every piece, ensuring that each tattoo is not only a form of self-expression but also a masterpiece in its own right. Visitors to Nov's studio consistently praise the meticulous attention to detail and the vibrant creativity infused in every tattoo."
